Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:45:15 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 59/59] route, dns: the debug line of a matched rule built only
 when it is logged

The routers built the description of every matched rule (Rule.String) on each connection and
DNS query only to choose between two debug texts, whatever the level of the log. The line is now
a MatchLine value the logger formats when it keeps the entry; the text is unchanged.

